@startuml

[*] --> InventoryManagement

state "Inventory Management" as InventoryManagement
InventoryManagement : entry / Start state
InventoryManagement : do / manage inventory operations

state "Add Goods" as AddGoods
AddGoods : entry / add new goods
AddGoods : do / add new goods to the inventory
AddGoods : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "Update Price" as UpdatePrice
UpdatePrice : entry / update price
UpdatePrice : do / update the price of existing items
UpdatePrice : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "Remove Goods" as RemoveGoods
RemoveGoods : entry / remove goods
RemoveGoods : do / remove goods from the inventory
RemoveGoods : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "Identify Expired Goods" as IdentifyExpired
IdentifyExpired : entry / identify expired goods
IdentifyExpired : do / notify user about removal of expired goods
IdentifyExpired : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "Place Order" as PlaceOrder
PlaceOrder : entry / place order
PlaceOrder : do / place an order for additional goods
PlaceOrder : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "Generate Invoice" as GenerateInvoice
GenerateInvoice : entry / generate invoice
GenerateInvoice : do / generate an invoice for the order
GenerateInvoice : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "Search Items" as SearchItems
SearchItems : entry / search items
SearchItems : do / search for items available in the inventory and select them for purchase
SearchItems : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "Calculate Discount and Tax" as CalculateDiscountTax
CalculateDiscountTax : entry / calculate discount and tax
CalculateDiscountTax : do / calculate applicable discount and tax based on selected items
CalculateDiscountTax : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "Generate Receipt" as GenerateReceipt
GenerateReceipt : entry / generate receipt
GenerateReceipt : do / generate a receipt for the customer after purchase
GenerateReceipt : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "Replace Item or Cancel Receipt" as ReplaceCancel
ReplaceCancel : entry / replace item or cancel receipt
ReplaceCancel : do / replace an item or cancel the receipt during billing process if needed
ReplaceCancel : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "Record Customer Requests" as RecordRequests
RecordRequests : entry / record customer requests
RecordRequests : do / record customer requests for items that may not be currently available
RecordRequests : exit / back to Inventory Management

state "View Transactions Summary" as ViewSummary
ViewSummary : entry / view transactions summary
ViewSummary : do / view a summary report of all transactions carried out in the system at any point
ViewSummary : exit / back to Inventory Management

InventoryManagement --> AddGoods
InventoryManagement --> UpdatePrice
InventoryManagement --> RemoveGoods
InventoryManagement --> IdentifyExpired
InventoryManagement --> PlaceOrder
InventoryManagement --> GenerateInvoice
InventoryManagement --> SearchItems
InventoryManagement --> CalculateDiscountTax
InventoryManagement --> GenerateReceipt
InventoryManagement --> ReplaceCancel
InventoryManagement --> RecordRequests
InventoryManagement --> ViewSummary

@enduml
